From 7d9102a7835df2b7a39fdcb01c25c633cf34939d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bench <bench@local>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 17:57:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] null patch: 36-pathfinder-walls

The planner walls blocks whose motion effect the fork does not model: one list with the patch 30 gate (is_unmodelled_block), neighbour walls for honey sides and piston faces, and a world border margin.
